  "question": {
    "text": "Four rods each of length <math><mi>l</mi></math> have been hinged to form a rhombus. Vertex <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is fixed to rigid support, vertex <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is being moved along the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> -axis with a constant velocity <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math> as shown in the figure. The rate at which vertex <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is approaching the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> -axis at the moment the rhombus is in the form of a square is -<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-06-30_at_5.09.01_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 176px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
